# Normain App — Permissions Catalog

> Working list of every permission available in the Normain app. Feeds the roles/permissions section of the KPMG deliverable.
>
> **Scoped-variant note:** rows with scope `Team (any / own)` likely split into two permissions — acting on *any* team vs only teams the actor belongs to (mirroring "Add member to team" vs "…team I'm a part of"). Confirm whether that split is a general pattern.

## Confirmed permissions

| Category | Permission | Description | Scope |
|---|---|---|---|
| Org / tenant | Add member to org | Add a new user to the Normain organization | Org |
| Org / tenant | Remove member from org | Remove a user from the Normain organization | Org |
| Org / tenant | Edit org settings | Change organization-level settings | Org |
| Teams | Create team | Create a new team within the organization | Org |
| Teams | Add member to team | Add a user to any team | Org |
| Teams | Add member to team I'm a part of | Add a user to a team the acting user is a member of | Team |
| Teams | Remove member from team | Remove a user from a team | Team (any / own) |
| Teams | Edit team | Rename / change team settings | Team (any / own) |
| Teams | Archive / delete team | Archive or delete a team | Team (any / own) |
| Teams | View teams | See teams (all teams vs only own) | Team (any / own) |
| Members / users | Resend / revoke invitation | Manage pending invitations | Org |
| SharePoint / integrations | Setup SharePoint integration | Configure the SharePoint integration for the organization | Org |
| SharePoint / integrations | Assign SharePoint site to team | Connect a SharePoint site to a specific team | Team |
| SharePoint / integrations | Remove SharePoint site from team | Disconnect a site from a team | Team (any / own) |
| SharePoint / integrations | View connected SharePoint sites | See which sites are connected | Org / Team |
| SharePoint / integrations | Disconnect SharePoint integration | Remove the org SharePoint integration | Org |
| Audit & compliance | View audit log | View the activity / audit trail | Org |
| Audit & compliance | Export audit log | Export audit log data | Org |

